  + [correction] the prior non-reduction caution was preliminary and protected operational detectability rather than a competing faculty ontology
  + [primitive] GroundedIdentityIntegrity is the common faculty-level law of Honesty and Security
  + [fault] a material causal identity delta that is not authentically declared, supported, authorized where applicable, consequence-accounted, and uncertainty-preserving
  + [honesty] specializes semantic and epistemic identity continuity grounded by correspondence, evidence, status, attribution, and context
  + [security] specializes agency, authority, constraint, protected-subject, and effect identity continuity grounded by harm, stability, and admissibility
  + [detection_boundary] no detectable material delta within declared observation scope is not proof that no falsehood, harm, or violation exists
  + [accumulation] sub-threshold deltas remain accountable because their trajectory may become material
  + [layering] this is a faculty-level primitive compiled from inspectable SAIL operations rather than a presently authorized base opcode
  + [implementation_result] is none
  + [schedule_effect] CIFP-SLICE-02 remains blocked pending conflict-aware HSIBI-SJS-01
  + [next] process both preserved source snapshots and revise HSIBI-007 and HSIBI-008 through SJS

