  + [Planner] centrally projects objectives, dependencies, temporal constraints, effects, reviews, and uncertainty into candidate paths
  + [Calendar] records selected commitments, availability, deadlines, recurrences, reminders, wakes, and review checkpoints without conflating proposals with commitments
  + [repository] appends material events and content-addressed semantic snapshots while Git remains a human-facing projection
  + [ChangeCapsule] binds prior intent, actual and semantic diffs, justification, support, requirements, calendar, compiler impact, review, and admitted after state
  + [Walking_Attention] forward continuity, rear diff review, tandem release, and reentry are fidelity-mapped without importing hidden-attention claims
  + [concurrency] forward candidate preparation may overlap rear review while dependent admission and effects remain version- and reflection-gated
  + [compiler] forward lowering and target generation join rear semantic-diff, invalidation, correspondence, and proof review
  + [seven_fold_convergence] one immutable versioned ChangeCapsule walk joins Planner projection, material event preservation, rear review, Observer admission, and dependent release
  + [cadence_resolution] every moment means every materially observable semantic, tool, effect, review, calendar, fault, and reentry boundary under explicit retention
  + [concurrency_resolution] forward preparation may overlap rear review while exact version and reflection barriers prevent shared mutation and premature dependent release
  + [explosion_state] is seven_fold_phase_locked_unsigned
  + [implementation_result] is none
  + [schedule_effect] CTPR-SJS-01 follows SMTC-SJS-01 and precedes COS Operator Shell implementation
  + [next] complete semantic refinement, data design, import fidelity, justification, registry, and signature before the deterministic logical-time proof

